# Stage 3, camera paths on the game's follow camera: F5 adds the camera's pose (yaw, pitch, orbit distance)
# as a key, Shift+F5 clears, F6 plays the keys (Catmull-Rom, BB_CAMERA_PATH_S seconds a key, eased ends)
# through the orbit's machinery (neutral pad, auto-rotation held, ends at loads, lock-on, menu); keys kept
# in camera_path.txt in the user folder. Stage 4, time: F8 freeze for stills (the flip thread holds the
# game's flip, BB_CAMERA_FREEZE_S limit). Slow motion is NOT in it (no safe lever without the game patch).
# Keys only: nothing runs and nothing is read before one of F5, F6, F8 is pressed, except one relaxed load
# per flip and two relaxed stores per follow-camera update.
